<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1673321360"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:19.269"><div begin="19.146" end="45.092" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.146" end="24.141" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.146" end="20.164">梦不</span><span begin="20.164" end="20.598">到</span> <span begin="20.598" end="21.380">回不</span><span begin="21.380" end="21.845">到</span> <span begin="21.845" end="22.714">那</span><span begin="22.714" end="23.589">段时</span><span begin="23.589" end="24.141">光</span></p><p begin="25.856" end="31.305" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.856" end="27.264">有一些</span><span begin="27.264" end="27.630">苦</span><span begin="27.630" end="28.435">涩 沾</span><span begin="28.435" end="29.383">湿</span><span begin="29.383" end="29.809">了</span><span begin="29.809" end="30.500">眼</span><span begin="30.500" end="31.305">眶</span></p><p begin="32.184" end="38.694" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.184" end="33.154">就算</span><span begin="33.154" end="33.647">是</span><span begin="33.647" end="34.432">忧</span><span begin="34.432" end="35.343">愁</span> <span begin="35.677" end="37.069">也不想</span><span begin="37.069" end="37.772">隐</span><span begin="37.772" end="38.694">藏</span></p><p begin="38.704" end="45.092" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.704" end="39.509">安</span><span begin="39.569" end="40.307">静的</span><span begin="40.307" end="41.212">世</span><span begin="41.212" end="41.933">界最</span><span begin="41.933" end="42.854">适</span><span begin="42.854" end="43.790">合疗</span><span begin="43.790" end="45.092">伤</span></p></div><div begin="46.165" end="1:14.032" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.165" end="51.428" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.165" end="48.403">以为你 是我</span><span begin="48.403" end="48.830">的</span> <span begin="48.830" end="49.644">地</span><span begin="49.644" end="50.434">久天</span><span begin="50.434" end="51.428">长</span></p><p begin="52.907" end="58.598" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.907" end="54.732">我毫无保</span><span begin="54.732" end="55.115">留</span> <span begin="55.115" end="55.594">做</span><span begin="55.594" end="56.499">你</span><span begin="56.499" end="56.816">的</span><span begin="56.816" end="57.587">肩</span><span begin="57.587" end="58.598">膀</span></p><p begin="59.153" end="1:05.608" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.153" end="1:00.719">思念太</span><span begin="1:00.719" end="1:01.554">渺</span><span begin="1:01.554" end="1:02.270">茫</span> <span begin="1:02.718" end="1:04.010">寂寞太</span><span begin="1:04.010" end="1:04.901">宽</span><span begin="1:04.901" end="1:05.608">广</span></p><p begin="1:05.618" end="1:14.032" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.618" end="1:06.445">我</span><span begin="1:06.600" end="1:07.310">相信</span><span begin="1:07.310" end="1:08.262">时</span><span begin="1:08.262" end="1:09.128">间会</span><span begin="1:09.128" end="1:09.881">给</span><span begin="1:09.881" end="1:10.915">我力</span><span begin="1:10.915" end="1:14.032">量</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.018" end="1:46.991" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:16.018" end="1:25.037" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.018" end="1:17.884">我有一棵</span><span begin="1:17.884" end="1:18.780">树</span> <span begin="1:18.841" end="1:19.282">种</span><span begin="1:19.282" end="1:19.846">在</span><span begin="1:19.846" end="1:20.625">心</span><span begin="1:20.625" end="1:22.039">上</span> <span begin="1:22.166" end="1:23.100">迎风</span><span begin="1:23.100" end="1:23.889">昂</span><span begin="1:23.889" end="1:25.037">扬</span></p><p begin="1:25.173" end="1:29.465" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.173" end="1:26.005">呼</span><span begin="1:26.005" end="1:26.447">唤</span><span begin="1:26.447" end="1:27.119">雨</span><span begin="1:27.119" end="1:27.727">水</span><span begin="1:27.727" end="1:28.154">和</span><span begin="1:28.154" end="1:28.975">阳</span><span begin="1:28.975" end="1:29.465">光</sp